86	// `taskScheduler` is the per-repo maintenance anchor the vendored hourly scheduler
87	// reads (per-project-scheduling DESIGN §2) — { dailyHour, weeklyDay, monthlyDay },
88	// all UTC. Absence means the documented defaults, so an omitted key is not an
89	// error; a present one is range-validated at load below. Its declaration is also
