99	// Does this project declare itself DORMANT? A project goes dormant when it is
100	// finished, parked, or simply not being worked on: it should stop paying the
101	// upkeep of a project that IS being worked on.
102	//
103	// What dormancy means, exactly — it is narrow on purpose:
